<p>
We are the Body of Christ.
</p>

<p>
He cannot go where<br>
we refuse to tread,<br>
speak what we<br>
refuse to say,<br>
or share what<br>
we refuse to give.
</p>

<p>
May we be the<br>
instruments of<br>
his love and grace.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


